      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_escalation_stairs",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Four escalation steps. Eighty-two burglaries. Then murder.",
          "words_spoken": 7,
          "est_dur_s": 2.33,
          "src_script": "2.05#1 · 2.05#7 · 5.07#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_escalation_stairs",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "He didn't start with violence. He began by standing outside bedroom windows in the dead of night.",
          "words_spoken": 17,
          "est_dur_s": 5.66,
          "src_script": "2.05#2 · 2.05#3 · 5.07#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_open_window",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Step one: nighttime voyeurism, lurking in the darkness to spy on women through their windows.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 5.81,
          "src_script": "2.05#2 · 2.05#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_drawer_dark",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Step two: breaking and entering for intimate property. He took neither cash nor jewelry. He stole women's underwear and personal belongings.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 8.13,
          "src_script": "2.05#4 · 2.05#8 · 2.05#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_folder_tree",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "His ritual remained identical in every house: photographing, taking items, and logging each event.",
          "words_spoken": 14,
          "est_dur_s": 5.42,
          "src_script": "2.05#10"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#6",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_brain_neural",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "When familiar acts ceased to satisfy, he fell into fantasy hunger, compelled to escalate the risk to recapture the initial high.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 7.99,
          "src_script": "3.05#7 · 3.05#8 · 3.05#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_open_window",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Step three: in September 2009, he invaded homes while the occupants were inside.",
          "words_spoken": 13,
          "est_dur_s": 5.04,
          "src_script": "2.05#11 · 2.05#12 · 2.05#13"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_two_chairs",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "And step four: in late November 2009, his victim was Corporal Marie-France Comeau, serving on the very base he commanded.",
          "words_spoken": 20,
          "est_dur_s": 7.75,
          "src_script": "2.05#14 · 2.05#15"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#9",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_house_missing",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Merely two months later, his next victim was Jessica Lloyd.",
          "words_spoken": 10,
          "est_dur_s": 3.33,
          "src_script": "2.05#16"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#10",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_oath_hall",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "In July 2009, his promotion to Base Commander at Trenton became the psychological trigger: absolute power combined with command stress shattered his final inhibitions.",
          "words_spoken": 24,
          "est_dur_s": 9.13,
          "src_script": "1.03#4 · 3.05#10"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#11",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_escalation_stairs",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Predatory crime never begins with a murder. It begins with an unpunished peeping gaze.",
          "words_spoken": 14,
          "est_dur_s": 4.66,
          "src_script": "5.07#5 · 5.07#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#12",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "tk02_podcast_desk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode two of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary via the link in our bio.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 4.99,
          "src_script": "CTA"
        }
      ]
    },
    "TK2": {
      "id": "TK2",
      "title": "Matching Tire Treads. Yet the Police Saluted Him on His Way",
      "theme": "The Halo Effect & Collective Institutional Blind Spots",
      "psychological_signs": [
        9,
        1
      ],
      "bgm": "bgm_sub_drone.mp3",
      "sfx": [
        "amb_road_night.wav (bed)",
        "fx_tire_snow.wav",
        "fx_window_down.wav",
        "fx_flashlight.wav",
        "fx_police_radio.wav"
      ],
      "overlays": [
        {
          "after_id": "TK2.01#5",
          "text": "MOBILE ROADBLOCK · NIGHT OF FEB 4",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK2.01#9",
          "text": "RECORDED THE INFO — THEN SALUTED HIM ON",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK2.01#10",
          "text": "THE HALO EFFECT: INVISIBLE SOCIAL SHIELD",
          "dur_s": 3.0
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_checkpoint",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Matching tire treads. And the police still respectfully saluted that man on his way.",
          "words_spoken": 14,
          "est_dur_s": 4.66,
          "src_script": "1.14#4 · 1.14#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_oath_hall",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "In July 2009, Colonel Russell Williams assumed supreme command of Canadian Forces Base Trenton.",
          "words_spoken": 14,
          "est_dur_s": 4.66,
          "src_script": "1.03#1 · 1.03#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_oath_hall",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "He had piloted VIP flights for Queen Elizabeth the Second.",
          "words_spoken": 10,
          "est_dur_s": 3.33,
          "src_script": "1.05#1"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_house_missing",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "On the night of January 28th, 2010, twenty-seven-year-old Jessica Lloyd vanished from her home in Belleville.",
          "words_spoken": 16,
          "est_dur_s": 6.2,
          "src_script": "1.10#1 · 1.10#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_checkpoint",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Police found no leads during the first days. One week later, on February 4th, they ran an all-night mobile roadblock hunting a rare off-road tire tread in the snow.",
          "words_spoken": 29,
          "est_dur_s": 11.23,
          "src_script": "1.12#1 · 1.12#2 · 1.12#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_suv_stop",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Among the vehicles passing through that night was a Nissan Pathfinder, instead of his usual BMW.",
          "words_spoken": 16,
          "est_dur_s": 6.2,
          "src_script": "1.14#1 · 1.14#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_suv_stop",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "The man behind the wheel rolled down the window: the Base Commander of CFB Trenton himself.",
          "words_spoken": 16,
          "est_dur_s": 6.2,
          "src_script": "1.14#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#8",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_tire_track",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "His tire tread matched the impressions in the snow almost perfectly.",
          "words_spoken": 11,
          "est_dur_s": 3.66,
          "src_script": "1.14#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#9",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_checkpoint",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Yet faced with a high-ranking officer, patrolmen could not detain him: they logged his details, saluted, and let him go. For three more days, he remained a free colonel.",
          "words_spoken": 29,
          "est_dur_s": 11.23,
          "src_script": "1.14#5 · 1.14#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#10",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_siren_wall",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "The Halo Effect: an invisible shield that blinded both society and law enforcement for years.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 5.7,
          "src_script": "1.08#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#11",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "tk02_podcast_desk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode two of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary via the link in our bio.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 4.99,
          "src_script": "CTA"
        }
      ]
    },
