          "dur_s": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "tk02_two_drawers",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Two lives. One body. A story to self-justify.",
          "words_spoken": 8,
          "est_dur_s": 2.66,
          "src_script": "3.08#1 · 3.08#8"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_two_masks",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Before analyzing: no official clinical psychiatric diagnosis has ever been released regarding Russell Williams. This is an analytical framework, not a moral trial.",
          "words_spoken": 23,
          "est_dur_s": 7.66,
          "src_script": "3.04#1 · 3.04#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#3",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_brain_neural",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "In psychology, compartmentalization is a defense mechanism that locks two contradictory cognitive streams into separate mental drawers.",
          "words_spoken": 17,
          "est_dur_s": 6.46,
          "src_script": "3.08#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#4",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_command_chair",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "The first drawer was the colonel: an exemplary commander and devoted husband tending his garden.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 5.7,
          "src_script": "3.08#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#5",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_stairs_dark",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "The second drawer was the nocturnal predator, where he unleashed his darkest impulses.",
          "words_spoken": 13,
          "est_dur_s": 4.94,
          "src_script": "3.08#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#6",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_two_drawers",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Inside this drawer, he locked the door to the other, using his wife and respectable marriage as a shield.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 7.23,
          "src_script": "3.08#6 · 3.08#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "tk02_drawer_dark",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "To silence conscience, he neutralized guilt. Through eighty-two break-ins, he told himself: <#0.35#> I only watched, I harmed no one, I only kept a souvenir.",
          "words_spoken": 24,
          "est_dur_s": 9.13,
          "src_script": "3.08#8"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#8",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_hidden_drive",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "When violence escalated to murder, he rationalized that the victim had seen his face, forcing him to act in self-defense.",
          "words_spoken": 20,
          "est_dur_s": 7.61,
          "src_script": "3.08#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#9",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_hidden_drive",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Consequently, he could never offer a genuine moral explanation.",
          "words_spoken": 9,
          "est_dur_s": 3.42,
          "src_script": "3.08#10"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#10",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_interrogation_early",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "When asked why he did it, his confession was chillingly hollow: <#0.35#> Yes, but I don't know the answers, and I'm pretty sure the answers don't matter.",
          "words_spoken": 26,
          "est_dur_s": 9.89,
          "src_script": "3.08#11"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#11",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_head_down",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "That was the most callous reply, laying bare the predator's total moral disconnection.",
          "words_spoken": 13,
          "est_dur_s": 4.94,
          "src_script": "3.08#12"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#12",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "tk02_podcast_desk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode two of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary via the link in our bio.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 4.99,
          "src_script": "CTA"
        }
      ]
    },
