      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_interrogation_early",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Not a single apology mentioned the victims.",
          "words_spoken": 7,
          "est_dur_s": 2.33,
          "src_script": "4.11#6 · 4.11#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#2",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "tk02_two_chairs",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "In the interrogation room, his anxiety focused entirely on how his wife viewed him, and the base's reputation. He never voiced remorse for the women or their families.",
          "words_spoken": 28,
          "est_dur_s": 10.65,
          "src_script": "4.11#6 · 4.11#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#3",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "tk02_head_down",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "That was not genuine contrition: it was intense self-pity as the mask of honor built over twenty-five years disintegrated.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 7.23,
          "src_script": "4.11#8 · 4.11#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#4",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_courtroom",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "On October 18th, 2010, he pleaded guilty to all eighty-eight charges.",
          "words_spoken": 11,
          "est_dur_s": 3.66,
          "src_script": "5.02#1 · 5.02#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#5",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "tk02_gavel",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Three days later, the judge sentenced him to concurrent life sentences with no eligibility for parole for twenty-five years.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 6.32,
          "src_script": "5.02#4 · 5.02#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#6",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_courtroom",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Yet the ultimate sentence for a narcissist was the destruction of honor: his rank revoked, his medals physically cut to pieces.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 6.99,
          "src_script": "5.04#1 · 5.04#2 · 5.04#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#7",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_uniform_fire",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "The Canadian military took an unprecedented step: burning all uniforms bearing his name in a classified incinerator.",
          "words_spoken": 17,
          "est_dur_s": 5.66,
          "src_script": "5.04#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_uniform_fire",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "According to military spokesman Hubert Genest: no ceremony, and no photographs were permitted.",
          "words_spoken": 13,
          "est_dur_s": 5.04,
          "src_script": "5.04#6 · 5.04#7"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#9",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_brain_neural",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Psychologically, it was a textbook narcissistic collapse: stripped of control, the predator is left with nothing but pathetic self-pity.",
          "words_spoken": 19,
          "est_dur_s": 7.23,
          "src_script": "5.06#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "tk02_podcast_desk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode two of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary via the link in our bio.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 4.99,
          "src_script": "CTA"
        }
      ]
    },
    "TK5": {
      "id": "TK5",
      "title": "Always Trust Your Intuition",
      "theme": "Victimology & Critical Survival Warning Signals (Boundaries & Intuition)",
      "psychological_signs": [
        10
      ],
      "bgm": "bgm_ambient_deep.mp3",
      "sfx": [
