      ],
      "overlays": [
        {
          "after_id": "TK5.01#1",
          "text": "NEVER RATIONALIZE VAGUE UNEASE",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK5.01#2",
          "text": "EARLIEST SIGNAL: BOUNDARY INTRUSION",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK5.01#4",
          "text": "CRIME STARTS WITH MINOR TRESPASSES",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK5.01#7",
          "text": "ALWAYS TRUST YOUR SURVIVAL INTUITION",
          "dur_s": 3.0
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_red_flags",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "If you sense an ambiguous unease, if your personal boundaries are breached in the slightest way, never rationalize or dismiss it.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 6.99,
          "src_script": "5.08#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#2",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_town_snow",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "In this case, before the truth came out, the town of Tweed lived under an intangible, suffocating dread.",
          "words_spoken": 18,
          "est_dur_s": 6.97,
          "src_script": "4.06#1"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#3",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.04,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "tk02_cottage_search",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Personal items were mysteriously rearranged, doors showed signs of prying, but no money was taken. We assumed we were just paranoid.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 7.34,
          "src_script": "4.06#2 · 4.06#3"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#4",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "tk02_escalation_stairs",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Predatory crime never begins with a murder. It begins with minor boundary crossings: a peeping gaze, rummaging through private drawers, an unpunished trespass.",
          "words_spoken": 23,
          "est_dur_s": 7.66,
          "src_script": "5.07#5 · 5.07#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#5",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "tk02_oath_hall",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Status, degrees, and splendid military rank are merely social overcoats; they offer no guarantee for the decency of a human soul.",
          "words_spoken": 21,
          "est_dur_s": 7.99,
          "src_script": "5.07#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "tk02_escalation_stairs",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "A narcissist's arrogance invariably leaves a trail.",
          "words_spoken": 7,
          "est_dur_s": 2.71,
          "src_script": "5.08#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "tk02_red_flags",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Always trust your intuition. Survival intuition is our built-in early warning radar designed to protect our lives.",
          "words_spoken": 17,
          "est_dur_s": 6.58,
          "src_script": "5.08#3 · 5.08#5"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#8",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "tk02_podcast_desk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode two of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary via the link in our bio.",
          "words_spoken": 15,
          "est_dur_s": 4.99,
          "src_script": "CTA"
        }
      ]
    }
